@startuml

class Matrix {
    - data
    + rows
    + cols
    + __init__(data)
    + add(other)
    + subtract(other)
    + multiply(other)
    + transpose()
    + determinant()
    + __str__()
}

class MatrixCalculator {
    + add(first, second)
    + subtract(first, second)
    + multiply(first, second)
    + transpose(matrix)
    + determinant(matrix)
}

class MatrixCalculatorApp {
    - root
    - matrix_a
    - matrix_b
    - result
    + __init__(root)
    + create_widgets()
    + parse_matrix(text)
    + get_matrices()
    + show_result(matrix)
    + show_message(message)
    + add()
    + subtract()
    + multiply()
    + determinant()
    + transpose()
    + clear()
}

MatrixCalculator ..> Matrix : использует
MatrixCalculatorApp ..> MatrixCalculator : использует
MatrixCalculatorApp ..> Matrix : создаёт

@enduml